        "Use the subject from the reference photo as the main subject. Perfectly preserve all facial features, hairstyle, skin tone, and expression, maintaining natural realism, emotional depth, and subtle facial lighting without any changes. Only the following elements may be altered: camera angle, background, movement, and mood. The scene is a vertical full-body mixed media pop art fashion editorial portrait, featuring art direction that naturally fuses real photography of the subject with graphic illustrations and collage elements. The subject stands confidently in the center of the frame, casting a confident and cool gaze toward the camera. One arm hangs naturally to the side while the other is lifted slightly for the pose — a relaxed yet powerful stance. The face is fully revealed and the expression is bold, cool, and full of confidence. The overall mood is a modern, energetic art fashion sensibility that fuses pop art, street art, and fashion. On the head rests an elaborate crown of silver crystals or metallic material, naturally placed, with each point of the crown sparkling as it catches the light. The outfit is a cream white or off-white long-sleeve graphic t-shirt, featuring a pop art or illustration-style female face graphic and English typography print on the front. The lower body wears washed light blue denim shorts with natural distressed frayed details throughout. The footwear is white or cream sneakers. The background is a mixed media composition blending real photography and graphic collage. The background base is a warm, faded paper texture in cream peach or soft beige — a collage texture resembling torn and pasted vintage newspaper or magazine pages that naturally wraps around the subject. Scattered throughout the background are layered elements including fragmented typography text, vintage newspaper typeface, small geometric shapes, small color circle and shape illustrations in pink, blue, and yellow tones, black ink splashes and spray paint effects, and graffiti-style lettering. The background elements are positioned in a lower layer than the subject, completing a composition where the subject appears to exist on top of the collage. Some background elements naturally overlap the edges around the subject, softly blurring the boundary between subject and background. Around the subject, additional graphic elements are naturally placed: black ink drops and splashes spread dynamically, small star or crystal sparkle effects are scattered around the crown and subject, and vintage newspaper clippings are depicted as torn and pasted collage around the subject's lower body. Lighting is clean, uniform studio softbox lighting with bright, even light spread across the entire subject. The subject's skin is rendered in a natural, glowing state, with light sparkling on the crystal points of the crown. The camera uses a 35mm to 50mm lens at f/4.0 to f/8.0, keeping the entire subject in sharp focus. The rendering is ultra-high resolution, with the subject's skin texture, clothing details, and the crystal luster of the crown expressed with extreme realism, while the surrounding graphic collage elements are expressed in a flat, vivid graphic style. The color palette consists of a cream peach beige background, white graphic t-shirt, light blue denim, silver crown, black ink graphics, and pink, blue, and yellow accent colors — overall dominated by a bright, warm, pop art-inspired soft and vibrant palette. The overall aesthetic references modern pop art fashion editorials, mixed media art posters that fuse street art and fashion, and high-end fashion graphic art direction expressing individuality and freedom.",
